Package: project
Title: R packages of the documentation
Version: 1.0.0
Description: Lists the R packages that the code chunks of docs/*/index.qmd
    need, with optional minimum versions. They are installed by `make setup`
    locally and by the action r-lib/actions/setup-r-dependencies in CI, both
    with pak, which also installs the system libraries the packages require.
    knitr and rmarkdown are needed by Quarto; add the packages of the
    project's own code chunks below them.
Imports:
    knitr (>= 1.45),
    rmarkdown (>= 2.25),
    ggplot2 (>= 3.5.0)
Encoding: UTF-8
